轮询逻辑：
```ts
const hasRunning = computed(() => items.value.some((item) => isRunningState(item.state)))

function pageVisible(): boolean {
  return typeof document !== 'undefined' && document.visibilityState === 'visible'
}

function stopPolling(): void {
  if (pollTimer !== undefined) {
    window.clearInterval(pollTimer)
    pollTimer = undefined
  }
}

function syncPolling(): void {
  if (hasRunning.value && pageVisible()) {
    if (pollTimer === undefined) {
      pollTimer = window.setInterval(() => { void silentRefresh() }, 15000)
    }
  } else {
    stopPolling()
  }
}

function onVisibilityChange(): void {
  if (pageVisible() && hasRunning.value) void silentRefresh()
  syncPolling()
}

watch(hasRunning, syncPolling)
```

onMounted:
```ts
onMounted(() => {
  document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', onVisibilityChange)
  void load()
  void loadAgents()
})
```

onUnmounted:
```ts
onUnmounted(() => {
  document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange', onVisibilityChange)
  stopPolling()
  if (keywordTimer !== undefined) window.clearTimeout(keywordTimer)
})
```

watch(hasRunning, syncPolling) 需要 import watch。syncPolling 在 watch 里会在 hasRunning 变化时调用。同时 load 后 items 变化触发 hasRunning 变化 → syncPolling。好。

但 watch(hasRunning, syncPolling) 默认非 immediate，首次 load 完成后 items 有值触发 hasRunning 变化（从 false → true），会调用 syncPolling。如果首次就没有 running，则 hasRunning 保持 false，不触发 syncPolling，但 pollTimer 本来就是 undefined，无需清理。OK。

不过有个边界：如果首次加载就有 running，hasRunning 从 false→true，watch 触发 syncPolling → startPolling。好。

displayStats:
```ts
const displayStats = computed(() => {
  const total = stats.value.total ?? items.value.length
  const inputRequired = stats.value.input_required ?? items.value.filter(i => i.state === 'input_required').length
  const authRequired = stats.value.auth_required ?? items.value.filter(i => i.state === 'auth_required').length
  const failed = stats.value.failed ?? items.value.filter(i => i.state === 'failed').length
  return { total, inputRequired, authRequired, failed }
})
```

注意：stats.value 是 Record<string, number>，索引访问返回 number | undefined（noUncheckedIndexedAccess），所以 `stats.value.total` 类型是 number | undefined，`?? items.length` 正确。同理 input_required。

